Base model
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct, by the Qwen team (Alibaba Cloud)
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct
revision ebb281ec70b05090aa6165b016eac8ec08e71b17
License: Apache License 2.0

- models/final_diffusion/backbone/ holds the base model's files unmodified.
  The two large safetensors files are also stored split into 1 GiB parts
  (*.part-NNN, parts_manifest.json) for Git LFS; scripts/restore_model_files.py
  joins them back into the original bytes (SHA-256 checked). The model card
  (models/final_diffusion/backbone/README.md) is kept as published.
- Modified / derived works: everything under models/final_diffusion/ other than
  backbone/ (the LoRA adapters and the self-conditioning layers of the
  diffusion-only and diffusion-Jev models) was trained in this project on top
  of the base model. They are not released by, or endorsed by, the Qwen team.
- "Qwen" is a name of its owners; it is used here only to describe the base
  model (Apache License 2.0, section 6 grants no trademark rights).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The evaluation photos (A-OKVQA / MS COCO) and the video (lerobot/aloha_static_coffee)
used in the trials are not included in this repository; the reports describe them
and docs/video_practical/source/provenance.json records where the video came from.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data used for training (not included in this repository)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The weights were trained on text derived from public datasets and model
outputs; see docs/Diffusion-Jev_methods.md. Their own terms apply to the data:
UltraChat 200k (HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k), BoolQ, MultiNLI, SST-2, AG News,
GoEmotions, Civil Comments, CommonsenseQA, ARC, a Japanese Amazon review
dataset, and answers generated by Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct and gpt-oss-20b /
gpt-oss-120b (Apache License 2.0; served through the Groq API).

Some of these datasets (the Japanese Amazon review dataset, AG News) were
published for research / non-commercial use. The weights in this repository are
released for research; check those terms before any other use.
